name: hoist-loop-invariants
prereqs: [function-purity — the pure-function-call gate; the
  conservative arith/test-only fallback stands without it]
invariant: only an Assign whose var is written exactly once in the
  body, whose expr reads loop-invariant vars, and whose var is not
  read earlier in the iteration is moved out — behavior-preserving by
  construction. `rand`-style LCG calls and any exec/capture are
  refused.
scope: offered to all (estree owner, c, go, perl, python, rust, sh,
  zig — the texture generators' per-column hash is the motivating
  corpus case)
updates: none (first offer)
